{"report_id":"1wbnhk","is_trip_report":true,"reason":"The writer recounts three personal experiences with visual and spatial changes, despite ending with questions.","scenes":[{"place":"","order":1,"light":[],"colour":["astounding colours"],"motion":[],"geometry":["textures"],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"beings":[],"transition_trigger":["second attempt shortly after"],"affect":["astounded"],"quotes":[{"text":"My first attempt went okay but I definitely never got anywhere near breaking through.","start":465,"end":550,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"I was astounded at the colours and textures that I was seeing - it was like something out of a videogame.","start":551,"end":656,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":[],"colour":["other:astounding colours"],"motion":[],"geometry":["tactile-geometry-felt-textures"],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":[],"affect":["other:astounded"],"transition_trigger":["other:second attempt shortly after"],"place":"other:"}},{"place":"my room","order":2,"light":[],"colour":[],"motion":["flipping rapidly","dragged through"],"geometry":["fractal layouts","3D model poly count altering"],"material":[],"density":[],"scale":["infinite number of universes"],"beings":[],"transition_trigger":["later, lower [redacted] experience"],"affect":["exciting and not terrifying","hard to breath"],"quotes":[{"text":"the room's architecture seemed to flip between multiple different fractal layouts","start":997,"end":1078,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"It was as if my room was a 3D model and someone was rapidly altering the poly count.","start":1080,"end":1164,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"I felt that I was dragged through an infinite number of universes","start":1219,"end":1284,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_ancho